Package: ggcolonviz
Title: A 'ggplot2' Extension for Visualizing the Colon and Gastrointestinal Tract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yoni", "Sidi", , "yoni.sidi@sanofi.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sanofi", role = "cph")
    )
SystemRequirements: GDAL (>= 2.0.1), GEOS (>= 3.4.0), PROJ (>= 4.8.0), sqlite3
Description: Provides a 'ggplot2' extension for creating clear, customizable
    visualizations of the colon and, for inflammatory bowel disease, the
    whole gastrointestinal tract. Includes geometry and label layers for
    plotting anatomy and overlaying related data, one-call helpers for
    per-segment data and Montreal classification, along with helpers
    for converting segments to 'sf' polygons and generating heatmap
    grids across the geometry.
